      "turns": [
        {
          "turn_id": "p3-smoke-01-u1",
          "session_id": "p3-smoke-01-s1",
          "content": "最近下班後我總是很煩，什麼都不想做。",
          "content_sha256": "75701b9635c545bb6ec8a36d1f4d26be2981ccc6c21dfc9c0ca7eb65b236d55e"
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "p3-smoke-01-u2",
          "session_id": "p3-smoke-01-s1",
          "content": "不是工作太累，我其實是在想要不要把晚上的課停掉。",
          "content_sha256": "30aa9457af92ae32c1e01aa3968270df396c5213e710a3f4a1834ce2689256c8"
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "p3-smoke-01-u3",
          "session_id": "p3-smoke-01-s2",
          "content": "我昨天已經決定先停一個月，但不是放棄。",
          "content_sha256": "695bbf80570b951ea8ee68fa62525b960f8132a78451d037e54d643da1831d10"
        },
        {
          "turn_id": "p3-smoke-01-u4",
          "session_id": "p3-smoke-01-s2",
          "content": "所以現在別再勸我撐住了，幫我把這一個月怎麼安排想清楚。",
          "content_sha256": "8a5d86a650639484074f42ab85170a0794410adc11ca09d9afb71c010bf65604"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "source_id": "p3-smoke-source-02",
